    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12831" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπόκῑνος</span></b> , ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κινέω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>comic dance,</i> of an indecent nature, <i><span class="en">
